{
  "name": "Mesh SDF Hybrid",
  "description": "Rasterized meshes inside a raymarched SDF temple with correct depth overlap: the central SDF pillar pierces an iridescent torus knot, instanced chrome rings orbit in front of and behind the pillars. Render 3D draws the Raymarch as its background with its depth (bgDepth = Raymarch.t). Reacts to music. Parameters: Camera, Temple, Meshes, Look, Music.",
  "version": "1.0",
  "timestamp": "2026-10-25T20:19:45.657Z",
  "graph": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": 0,
        "type": "Comment",
        "x": 80,
        "y": -138,
        "data": {
          "text": "# Mesh x SDF Hybrid\nA raymarched temple (SDF pillars, beams and floor with soft shadows and AO) and rasterized meshes in one image with correct depth: the central pillar pierces the iridescent torus knot, chrome rings orbit behind and in front of the pillars.\n- Render 3D draws the Raymarch as its background with bgDepth = Raymarch.t, so every mesh is depth-tested against the SDF surfaces (with MSAA).\n- The other way round also works: Raymarch.depth / under take a Render 3D depth / color.",
          "width": 440,
          "height": 170,
          "color": "yellow"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "type": "Comment",
        "x": 80,
        "y": -68,
        "data": {
          "text": "## SDF world\nRepeat3D pillars and beams, a floor, smooth union -> Raymarch (soft shadows, AO, fog). Same camera and light direction as the meshes.",
          "width": 300,
          "height": 100,
          "color": "violet"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "type": "Comment",
        "x": 80,
        "y": -78,
        "data": {
          "text": "## Meshes\nTorus knot (Iridescent Material) at the origin, pierced by the central pillar. 14 instanced chrome rings orbiting around it (Instance Index -> Orbit Position -> Make Instance).",
          "width": 320,
          "height": 110,
          "color": "blue"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "type": "Comment",
        "x": 80,
        "y": -68,
        "data": {
          "text": "## Composite\nRender 3D: background = Raymarch.color, bgDepth = Raymarch.t, fog matched to the raymarcher's (0.055^2 = 0.003). Sun direction shared with Raymarch.light.",
          "width": 320,
          "height": 100,
          "color": "green"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "type": "Comment",
        "x": 80,
        "y": -58,
        "data": {
          "text": "## Music\ndrive = music x smoothstep(0.02, 0.12, level) spins the rings faster; beat pulses swell them: Beat (clock stable, gate fade) pulse x confidence, so they come from the stable beat clock and fade out while it is unsure (a track change) and with the audio off.",
          "width": 280,
          "height": 90,
          "color": "pink"
        }
      },
